{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1093613-a-thought","id":1093613,"title":"A thought...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-17T04:46:20-07:00","id":1093613,"title":"A thought...","content":"Coil of Zirnitra + Psychokinesis (Light) + Psychokinetic Resistance = No damage from Sunlight","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The best lies are wrapped in truth.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11526-lasellj","name":"lasellj","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11526_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T05:24:01-07:00","id":1093625,"title":"","content":"That's why the Coil description contains the following text:<br /> &quot;Not every human Supernatural Merit will work well within a Vampire chronicle. Use firm discretion, and discuss each given purchase with your Storyteller.&quot;<br /> <br /> There's also this line from Hurt Locker about Supernatural Merits:<br /> &quot;Adding a pyrokinetic character to your Vampire: The Requiem game might be a little diffcult. Then again, it might be awesome.&quot;<br /> <br /> Some might allow such combinations. Some might not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T05:29:33-07:00","id":1093627,"title":"","content":"Well, yes, there is -always- the caveat of &quot;the game allows whatever the Storyteller allows&quot;, so that really goes without saying. However, from a purely mechanics standpoint, a perfectly Daywalking Ordo seems incredibly viable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The best lies are wrapped in truth.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11526-lasellj","name":"lasellj","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11526_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T06:18:21-07:00","id":1093637,"title":"","content":"That's what Coil of the Ascendant leads to. Once you've mastered that Coil and put on some heavy clothing you can choose to stop taking damage from Sunlight. But it does cost Vitae equal to your BP per day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T07:13:54-07:00","id":1093648,"title":"","content":"&quot;Turns out, It's not actually the light that does the damage.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T09:32:37-07:00","id":1093683,"title":"","content":"Blood Sorcery cannot manipulate Banes. I don't let anything else do it, either, for this reason. A vampire with control over sunlight or fire is entirely idiotic and unthematic, in my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T11:25:14-07:00","id":1093715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1093613-a-thought?p=1093648#post1093648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Turns out, It's not actually the light that does the damage.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>As I've commented before... maybe the burning isn't actually the problem. Like, when you step on a nail and recoil in pain, the pain is useful -- it's a warning that you're hurt and in danger, rather than a sign that nails are your God-inflicted weakness. What if burning in the sunlight is there to protect Kindred from something worse?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-17T13:57:22-07:00","id":1093790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1093613-a-thought?p=1093715#post1093715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As I've commented before... maybe the burning isn't actually the problem. Like, when you step on a nail and recoil in pain, the pain is useful -- it's a warning that you're hurt and in danger, rather than a sign that nails are your God-inflicted weakness. What if burning in the sunlight is there to protect Kindred from something worse?</div> </div> </div> </div>This actually came up in a Chronicle just a few days ago. One of my players didn't like the idea that Kindred could wrap themselves in clothes to mitigate the damage, so we play it as the damage is not because the sun makes contact with you, but because when the sunlight envelops you you are being discovered by <i>something,</i> and that something really wants you to die. No idea what that something is gonna be yet though, and maybe we'll never find out, but it's enhanced our game.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The 'e' is omitted on purpose and for stylistc reasons... I promise.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13322-aneas","name":"Aneas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13322_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T00:11:18-07:00","id":1094018,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1093613-a-thought?p=1093715#post1093715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As I've commented before... maybe the burning isn't actually the problem. Like, when you step on a nail and recoil in pain, the pain is useful -- it's a warning that you're hurt and in danger, rather than a sign that nails are your God-inflicted weakness. What if burning in the sunlight is there to protect Kindred from something worse?</div> </div> </div> </div>This gives me some interesting ideas.<br /> <br /> I recall a novel I read in the 90s in which there was a kind of potion that would grant vampires resistance to sunlight. The sun would look pretty weird and disturbing to them, however. Take that a few steps further and yeah, this is cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T09:27:58-07:00","id":1094177,"title":"","content":"No no no no no no THIS IS NOT HOW THE GAME IS SUPPOSE TO BE PLAYED<br /> <br /> Ehem, ehem, have fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12561-shawarbaaz","name":"Shawarbaaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"467"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}